            "type": "object",
            "memo": "Operation schemes are listed in \"priority\" order. Note that each scheme must address the entire load and/or condition ranges for the simulation. The actual one selected for use will be the first that is \"Scheduled\" on. That is, if control scheme 1 is not \"on\" and control scheme 2 is -- then control scheme 2 is selected. Only condenser equipment should be listed on a Control Scheme for this item.",
