            "type": "object",
            "memo": "This object is used to set colors for reporting on various building elements particularly for the DXF reports. We know the user can enter 0 to 255 and the color map is available in DXF output. Therefore, we are limiting the colors in that range. You can extend by editing the IDD but you do so on your own. Colors not changed in any scheme will remain as the default scheme uses."
        },
